{"id": 6861, "date": "2026-08-20T13:07:00", "date_gmt": "2026-08-20T13:07:00", "guid": {"rendered": "https://artibits.com/?p=6861", "raw": "https://artibits.com/?p=6861"}, "modified": "2026-09-17T13:30:47", "modified_gmt": "2026-09-17T13:30:47", "password": "", "slug": "government-sector-qgira", "status": "publish", "type": "post", "link": "https://artibits.com/2026/08/20/government-sector-qgira/", "title": {"raw": "GOVERNMENT SECTOR - QGIRA", "rendered": "GOVERNMENT SECTOR &#8211; QGIRA"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>OFFLINE INSPECTION MANAGEMENT FOR A GOVERNMENT MINISTRY</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">QGira developed an offline- and online-capable mobile application that enables government inspectors to complete field inspections, capture supporting evidence, verify locations, and synchronize records through one digital platform.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>PROJECT OVERVIEW</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Sector:</strong> Government</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Solution:</strong> QGira Mobile Inspection Application</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> On-Site Inspection Management</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Access:</strong> Mobile and tablet</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Operating Mode:</strong> Online and offline</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>THE REQUIREMENT</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Field inspections are often conducted in locations where internet connectivity is limited or unavailable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The ministry required a reliable digital solution that would allow inspectors to complete the full inspection process in the field without depending on a continuous network connection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Key requirements included:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Offline inspection capability</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Secure data synchronization</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Location verification</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Automated scoring</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Multimedia evidence captures</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Digital acknowledgement and signatures</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>THE SOLUTION</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">QGira delivered a mobile inspection application designed for connected and disconnected field environments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The solution included:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Online and offline inspection workflows</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Automatic synchronization when connectivity is restored</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 GPS-based inspection location verification</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Automated questionnaire scoring</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Multi-format evidence captures</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Digital signatures for relevant parties</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Centralized inspection records</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Mobile-enabled field execution</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>HOW QGIRA WORKS</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Download \u2192 Inspect Offline \u2192 Capture Evidence \u2192 Sign \u2192 Synchronize \u2192 Review</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Inspectors download assigned activities before entering the field. They complete inspections, record findings, capture evidence, and obtain signatures offline. Once connectivity returns, the application automatically synchronizes the inspection data with the central system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>KEY CAPABILITIES</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>OFFLINE INSPECTIONS</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Inspectors can complete assigned inspections without an active internet connection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>AUTOMATIC SYNCHRONIZATION</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Inspection records automatically synchronize with the central platform when the device reconnects.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>GPS VERIFICATION</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Location tracking confirms that inspections were conducted at the assigned site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>AUTOMATED SCORING</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The application calculates inspection scores using responses recorded in the digital questionnaire.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>MULTI-FORMAT EVIDENCE</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Inspectors can capture text, documents, speech-to-text notes, audio, images, and video.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>DIGITAL SIGNATURES</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">Relevant parties can review and sign inspection records directly within the application.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child,\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Connectivity-dependent processes</td>\n            <td>Online and offline inspections</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Paper inspection forms</td>\n            <td>Mobile digital workflows</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual data transfer</td>\n            <td>Automatic synchronization</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Unverified site visits</td>\n            <td>GPS-confirmed inspections</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual score calculation</td>\n            <td>Automated scoring</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Limited evidence formats</td>\n            <td>Multimedia evidence capture</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Physical signatures</td>\n            <td>Digital signatures</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>PROJECT IMPACT</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">The mobile application created a more reliable, traceable, and efficient approach to government field inspections.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Key improvements included:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Continuous field execution without internet dependency</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Faster and more accurate data capture</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Improved inspection-location verification</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Consistent questionnaire scoring</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Stronger evidence and audit trails</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Reduced manual data transfer</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">\u2022 Centralized access to inspection records</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>KEY TAKEAWAY</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|black\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color\">QGira enabled inspectors to complete comprehensive field inspections from any location online or offline while maintaining accurate records, verified evidence, and centralized oversight.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->", "rendered": "\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-115 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>OFFLINE INSPECTION MANAGEMENT FOR A GOVERNMENT MINISTRY</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-116 wp-block-paragraph\">QGira developed an offline- and online-capable mobile application that enables government inspectors to complete field inspections, capture supporting evidence, verify locations, and synchronize records through one digital platform.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-117 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>PROJECT OVERVIEW</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-118 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Sector:</strong> Government</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-119 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Solution:</strong> QGira Mobile Inspection Application</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-120 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Purpose:</strong> On-Site Inspection Management</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-121 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Access:</strong> Mobile and tablet</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-122 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Operating Mode:</strong> Online and offline</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-123 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>THE REQUIREMENT</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-124 wp-block-paragraph\">Field inspections are often conducted in locations where internet connectivity is limited or unavailable.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-125 wp-block-paragraph\">The ministry required a reliable digital solution that would allow inspectors to complete the full inspection process in the field without depending on a continuous network connection.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-126 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Key requirements included:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-127 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Offline inspection capability</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-128 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Secure data synchronization</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-129 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Location verification</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-130 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Automated scoring</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-131 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Multimedia evidence captures</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-132 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Digital acknowledgement and signatures</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-133 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>THE SOLUTION</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-134 wp-block-paragraph\">QGira delivered a mobile inspection application designed for connected and disconnected field environments.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-135 wp-block-paragraph\">The solution included:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-136 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Online and offline inspection workflows</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-137 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Automatic synchronization when connectivity is restored</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-138 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 GPS-based inspection location verification</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-139 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Automated questionnaire scoring</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-140 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Multi-format evidence captures</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-141 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Digital signatures for relevant parties</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-142 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Centralized inspection records</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-143 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Mobile-enabled field execution</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-144 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>HOW QGIRA WORKS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-145 wp-block-paragraph\">Download \u2192 Inspect Offline \u2192 Capture Evidence \u2192 Sign \u2192 Synchronize \u2192 Review</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-146 wp-block-paragraph\">Inspectors download assigned activities before entering the field. They complete inspections, record findings, capture evidence, and obtain signatures offline. Once connectivity returns, the application automatically synchronizes the inspection data with the central system.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-147 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>KEY CAPABILITIES</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-148 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>OFFLINE INSPECTIONS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-149 wp-block-paragraph\">Inspectors can complete assigned inspections without an active internet connection.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-150 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>AUTOMATIC SYNCHRONIZATION</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-151 wp-block-paragraph\">Inspection records automatically synchronize with the central platform when the device reconnects.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-152 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>GPS VERIFICATION</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-153 wp-block-paragraph\">Location tracking confirms that inspections were conducted at the assigned site.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-154 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>AUTOMATED SCORING</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-155 wp-block-paragraph\">The application calculates inspection scores using responses recorded in the digital questionnaire.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-156 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>MULTI-FORMAT EVIDENCE</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-157 wp-block-paragraph\">Inspectors can capture text, documents, speech-to-text notes, audio, images, and video.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-158 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>DIGITAL SIGNATURES</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-159 wp-block-paragraph\">Relevant parties can review and sign inspection records directly within the application.</p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n.before-after-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n\n.before-after-table td {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    text-align: left;\n    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n    color: #333;\n}\n\n.before-after-table th:first-child,\n.before-after-table th:last-child {\n    width: 50%;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .before-after-table th {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        padding: 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .before-after-table td {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        padding: 13px 12px;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n\n<table class=\"before-after-table\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Before</th>\n            <th>After</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Connectivity-dependent processes</td>\n            <td>Online and offline inspections</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Paper inspection forms</td>\n            <td>Mobile digital workflows</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual data transfer</td>\n            <td>Automatic synchronization</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Unverified site visits</td>\n            <td>GPS-confirmed inspections</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Manual score calculation</td>\n            <td>Automated scoring</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Limited evidence formats</td>\n            <td>Multimedia evidence capture</td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr>\n            <td>Physical signatures</td>\n            <td>Digital signatures</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-160 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>PROJECT IMPACT</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-161 wp-block-paragraph\">The mobile application created a more reliable, traceable, and efficient approach to government field inspections.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-162 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Key improvements included:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-163 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Continuous field execution without internet dependency</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-164 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Faster and more accurate data capture</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-165 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Improved inspection-location verification</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-166 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Consistent questionnaire scoring</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-167 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Stronger evidence and audit trails</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-168 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Reduced manual data transfer</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-169 wp-block-paragraph\">\u2022 Centralized access to inspection records</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-170 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>KEY TAKEAWAY</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-171 wp-block-paragraph\">QGira enabled inspectors to complete comprehensive field inspections from any location online or offline while maintaining accurate records, verified evidence, and centralized oversight.</p>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>OFFLINE INSPECTION MANAGEMENT FOR A GOVERNMENT MINISTRY QGira developed an offline- and online-capable mobile application that enables government inspectors to complete field inspections, capture supporting evidence, verify locations, and synchronize records through one digital platform. PROJECT OVERVIEW Sector: Government Solution: QGira Mobile Inspection Application Purpose: On-Site Inspection Management Access: Mobile and tablet Operating Mode: Online [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 1, "featured_media": 6862, "comment_status": "open", "ping_status": "open", "sticky": false, "template": "", "format": "standard", "meta": {"footnotes": "", "_elementor_edit_mode": "", "_elementor_template_type": "", "_elementor_data": "", "_elementor_page_settings": null, "_elementor_conditions": []}, "categories": [118], "tags": [], "permalink_template": "https://artibits.com/2026/08/20/%postname%/", "generated_slug": "government-sector-qgira", "class_list": ["post-6861", "post", "type-post", "status-publish", "format-standard", "has-post-thumbnail", "hentry", "category-government"], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "https://artibits.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/6861", "targetHints": {"allow": ["GET", "POST", "PUT", "PATCH", "DELETE"]}}], "collection": [{"href": "https://artibits.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts"}], "about": [{"href": "https://artibits.com/wp-json/wp/v2/types/post"}], "author": [{"embe